    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Stopping While Loops",
    "descriptionContent": "Learn how to use a variable to stop a while loop",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17314,
        "title": "Break While Loops",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>So far we've learned how to create a while loop, now let's focus on how to stop them from looping infinitely.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146688,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To stop a loop, we start by creating a variable outside of the loop.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>let</code> followed by <code>gameRunning</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146689,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We use the variable in the condition to decide whether or not the loop should run its code block. For example, <code>(gameRunning === true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>gameRunning</code>, followed by <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inside the code block, we stop the loop by setting <code>gameRunning</code> to <code>false</code> so that the condition returns <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"107\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The loop runs its entire code block because <code>gameRunning</code> is <code>true</code> at first, but doesn't run again if we set <code>gameRunning</code> to <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameRunning: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + gameRunning);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we know this loop runs and never stops repeating its code block?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelLoaded = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">There's no variable in the condition</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">This loop won't run since the condition is <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">There's no variable in the condition.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we know the <code>while</code> loop skips its code block?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The value of <code>isPaused</code> is <code>false</code> but the condition is checking if it is <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The value of <code>isPaused</code> is <code>false</code> and the condition is checking if it is <code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The value of <code>isPaused</code> is <code>false</code> but the condition is checking if it is <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we know this loop stops?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Update player and enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>gameRunning</code> variable updates to <code>false</code> inside the code block</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">We don't know if the loop stops</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>gameRunning</code> variable updates to <code>false</code> inside the code block.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level start!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">This code displays nothing in the console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level start!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146696,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In order to use the variable in the while loop's condition, create it outside of the code block.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>let</code> followed by <code>gameRunning</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146697,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skip the loop by using the <code>isPaused</code> variable inside the condition.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inside the code block, stop the loop after running its code block by updating <code>gameRunning</code> to <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>gameRunning</code> followed by <code>=</code> and then <code>false</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inside the code block, stop the loop after running its code block by setting <code>gameRunning</code> to <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameRunning === \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
